From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:58:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 38/51] Give the sleep timer button visible feedback

Tapping the alarm icon in the fullscreen player's second control row
started the sleep timer silently: the only reaction was the icon
tint, and stopping it required a long-press that nothing hinted at.
Both actions now confirm themselves with a toast, and the start
toast mentions the long-press to cancel.
